{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Thus</b> — the sense is: even if you were as worthy as your father Jehozadak, who was High Priest in the First Temple. The vav of ונתתי is a weak vav in the language of Ishmael [Arabic]; likewise: והאבן הזאת אשר שמתי מצבה. And similarly: והחרמתי את עריהם. And behold, his reward is that he will walk among those standing, who are the angels."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {0 "I read כפ\"ה (appearing in some witnesses) as כפ\"ו (a gematria abbreviation for vav = 6, or possibly reading it as a reference to the vav of ונתתי); rendered literally here as the notation is elliptical."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:45:50.698994146Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}